{"unit_id": "marisa-4219__deepseek-harness-quota-monitor#feature-1", "repo": "marisa-4219/deepseek-harness-quota-monitor", "commit": "3856790995eaca45cf2a77f53412ec13f0ea615a", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "额度监控 的功能「额度与余额面板」：侧边栏为已发现或配置的供应商展示余额或额度窗口进度，并可展开查看统计详情。 操作在侧边栏或插件管理页完成。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:5", "lib/client.js:400"]}
{"unit_id": "marisa-4219__deepseek-harness-quota-monitor#feature-2", "repo": "marisa-4219/deepseek-harness-quota-monitor", "commit": "3856790995eaca45cf2a77f53412ec13f0ea615a", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "额度监控 的功能「本地窗口计量」：插件从 DSH 模型流读取 Token 用量，按配置的滑动窗口和供应商分别累计并保存记录。 操作在侧边栏或插件管理页完成。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:631", "lib/index.js:1297"]}
{"unit_id": "marisa-4219__deepseek-harness-quota-monitor#feature-3", "repo": "marisa-4219/deepseek-harness-quota-monitor", "commit": "3856790995eaca45cf2a77f53412ec13f0ea615a", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "额度监控 的功能「供应商余额查询」：按供应商配置的 URL、凭据引用和解析器请求余额或用量数据，并将结果转换为面板快照。 操作在侧边栏或插件管理页完成。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:60", "lib/index.js:439", "lib/index.js:954"]}
