{"unit_id": "marisa-4219__deepseek-harness-quota-monitor#caveat-1", "repo": "marisa-4219/deepseek-harness-quota-monitor", "commit": "3856790995eaca45cf2a77f53412ec13f0ea615a", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "额度监控 使用前须知：本地用量统计只计入经过 DSH 的模型请求，并将记录保存在 DSH storage 目录；供应商余额查询会请求对应配置的外部 API。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:631", "lib/index.js:954"]}
